# Sainte-Barbe Accessibility Baseline

- Keep mobile text readable: avoid `text-[9px]`/`text-[10px]`; prefer `text-xs` minimum and `text-sm` for body text.
- Preserve contrast AA on all text and controls, including text over photos/gradients.
- Keep keyboard focus visible on interactive elements (`focus-visible` ring/outline).
- Ensure touch targets are comfortable on mobile (prefer min `44x44`).
- Do not encode important state with color only; include icon/text labels.
- Re-check accessibility when changing navigation, cards, widgets, or hero sections.
